      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR FORTE (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.12) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Rates on top in this line up. MELTING MOMENTS (6) sprung the lids and led throughout to score by 3.5 lengths (18.64) at Dubbo in Grade 5. Is yet to find the frame here from three. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. HEART DESIRES (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.91) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Cannot be taken lightly. MY CAPE ESCAPE (8) cannot be dismissed although new to this venue.",
